#32600
Forest of Turra~
This area is an add on to the village of Turra.
It is a low level exp area with a few eq pieces.
It fits into the overall storyline of the Turr
It is also an add on to Mt Everwar and the city of Everwar
it links into the first room of Mt Everwar and room
20 of the village.
~
