#32601
Valley of Turra.~
        The valley of Turra is where the great Turra himself first
saw the fallen angel descend from the heavens onto the lands. It is here
that he was watching over his father's sheep when he saw her land on the
top of far off mountain. To the people of Turra the mountain is a holy
and revered spot, to others who have been in a vain search for the
gift of the gods, this was a place they had to have.
